        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3f31b4babcdb423ea127b6cf50ce85c6",
      "statement": "Every OpenWiki-specific detail is confined to app/services/wiki_runner.py, so upgrading the CLI is a container rebuild with a different OPENWIKI_VERSION build arg rather than a source change; if the CLI interface changes, that module is the only file to touch.",
