      "id": "claim_a34d0ebefd924f4499cc39bba7d610ed",
      "statement": "The test suite runs with `uv run pytest` after `uv pip install -e \".[test]\"` and exercises the full pipeline (clone -> fake OpenWiki CLI -> zip -> download) using tests/fixtures/fake_openwiki.py and an in-process worker, so no model provider or network access is needed.",
