    {
      "id": "claim_5b2b9ef6f2ec4efeb73fa9e10e6eaaf9",
      "statement": "Extension boundaries are fixed: new HTTP surface is a module under app/routers/ included in create_app(), business logic stays in app/services/ (routers never call git or the CLI directly), and API-to-worker coordination stays in app/core/storage.py, whose method contract (claim_next, heartbeat, complete, recover_stale, ...) is the seam to replace with a Postgres backend for multi-host scaling.",
